ne/godot/pulls/109722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109722","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109722.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109722.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:18Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nWhen serializing to GLTF, we don't want to write buffers if they're empty ([it's against spec](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/blob/27ec3a087d277fccc6d881fee03a8ab007044ea7/specification/2.0/schema/buffer.schema.json#L19)). This changes the serializing process so that empty buffers are not added to the document or written to disk (unless there are non-empty buffers subsequent to it, which is specifically handled).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"htt